{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785549783203,"sessionID":"ses_04501cd40ffewOC0br6SKhywMQ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"write_99","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0e7h4bd8/retort-584a25cb6bc2/tests/features/competitions.feature","content":"Feature: Competition Queries\n  As an LLM user I want standings and brackets calculated from\n  match results.\n\n  Scenario: Who won the 2019 Brasileirão\n    Given the match data is loaded\n    When I request the 2019 \"Brasileirão Série A\" standings\n    Then the champion should be \"Flamengo\" with 90 points\n    And the table should have 20 teams\n\n  Scenario: Standings are internally consistent\n    Given the match data is loaded\n    When I request the 2021 \"Brasileirão Série A\" standings\n    Then every team should have played 38 matches\n    And points should equal 3 per win plus 1 per draw\n\n  Scenario: Relegation zone\n    Given the match data is loaded\n    When I request the 2019 \"Brasileirão Série A\" standings\n    Then 4 teams should be marked as relegated\n\n  Scenario: Copa Libertadores bracket\n    Given the match data is loaded\n    When I request the 2018 \"Copa Libertadores\" bracket\n    Then the stages should include \"group stage\"\n    And the stages should include \"final\"\n"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-0e7h4bd8/retort-584a25cb6bc2/tests/features/competitions.feature","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"tests/features/competitions.feature","time":{"start":1785549783200,"end":1785549783203}},"id":"prt_fbb0f730b001bY4i6J4UN01rJI","sessionID":"ses_04501cd40ffewOC0br6SKhywMQ","messageID":"msg_fbb0f6b16001ZdWkahzkA3qQAl"}}
